Arts Northwestern Switzerland is one of the leading universities of applied sciences in Switzerland. Its\nten schools\noffer degree programmes, continuing education programmes, research and services.\nFHNW’s degree programmes are geared towards the practice. Flexible study options and modern learning conditions help you succeed in your studies.\nDiscover our\ndegree programmes\nand filter according to your interests, topics, degree type or teaching language.\nFurther information and help is available from the\ninternational offices\nof our schools.\nCampus life and sports\nFHNW is located at four main sites in Northwestern Switzerland. Information about campus infrastructure and sports at the individual sites is available on our\ncampus sites\n.\nIncoming students can enjoy the\nfull programme of the FHNW sports section\n.\nStudying in Switzerland\nWould you like to study in Switzerland? The information provided here is designed to help you.\nInformation on Switzerland\nContact\nInternational Affairs FHNW\nInternational Office\nE-Mail\ninternational@fhnw.ch"
